sequenceDiagram
    participant U as orbital-app
    participant K as Keycloak
    participant G as Gateway
    participant S as Backend service

    Note over U,S: Proposed design — not implemented (Section 3.9)

    U->>K: Authorization Code + PKCE login
    K-->>U: JWT (access token)
    U->>G: request + Bearer JWT
    G->>K: fetch JWKS (cached, TTL)
    K-->>G: signing keys
    G->>G: validate signature + claims
    alt valid token
        G->>S: proxy request
        S-->>G: response
        G-->>U: response
    else invalid/missing token
        G-->>U: 401 Unauthorized
    end
